'''Yoichi''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that could be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 114
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Yoichi
|name2 = Yoichi CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Yoichi CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is completely useless. Although it has decent range at 340, its stats and abilities are pathetic. Single target units do not fare well against Dark enemies due to their extremely high damage and low range, meaning it will barely have any effect in action. It is completely outclassed by many other reliable anti-Dark units such as [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Assassin BearCat]].

